				<title>SCP-5127</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5127</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Item #: SCP-5127&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object class: Euclid&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5127 is to be kept inside a standard humanoid containment chamber. SCP-5127&#039;s scroll with an ink pen should be kept on his desk. SCP-5127 is to be worshipped weekly by Class-D personnel. In the event of a containment breach, SCP-5127&#039;s containment chamber is to be completely locked down, And chamber temperature should be dropped to -2.222 degrees celsius. Once the containment breach ends, The chambers temperature should be restored to normal. If SCP-5127 is not present in its containment chamber during a containment breach, All site doors are to be locked down to prevent escape of SCP-5127.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5127 resembles an ancient Egyptian Anubis statue composed of clay. When temperature is above -2.222 degrees celsius and bellow 1,780&amp;#160;°C (Clays freezing and melting point) SCP-5127 will become animate. Whenever 5127 is referred to as SCP-5127, SCP-5127 will demand to be referred to as Anubis.&lt;br /&gt;
It is found that SCP-5127 holds all knowledge of time before christ (B.C.) and writes it onto his scroll.&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5127&#039;s scroll seems to be infinite, And therefore has been designated SCP-5127-1. At time of writing, SCP-5127 has written history of time up to 25 BC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewed: SCP-5127&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer: Doctor ███████&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; Welcome SCP-5127, Have a seat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5127:&lt;/strong&gt; Don&#039;t call me that. I am Anubis, And you must address me as Anubis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; Uhm, Ok. Can you tell me about how you were created.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5127 (Muttering):&lt;/strong&gt; [INAUDIABLE] fool. Doesn&#039;t know common knowledge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; Could you repeat that?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5127:&lt;/strong&gt; No. I am a god. You are a fool who doesn&#039;t address me by my name. You lock me up in some prison for gods, And you think that I will answer your question! Why can&#039;t I speak with one of my worshippers that visit me every week. They know how to talk to me. And how to worship me.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; I&#039;m sorry, SCP-5127. But being a god doesn&#039;t do anything here. If you want any chance of getting out all you can do is atleast comply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5127:&lt;/strong&gt; No.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; I see thats how it is, Then.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctor ███████ leaves and activates the room freezer. After SCP-5127 is frozen, SCP-5127 is sent back into containment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Footnotes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
A sample of the clay SCP-5127 is composed of shows that SCP-5127 was created 22 centuries ago.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/qya&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7162427&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609921887&quot; alt=&quot;Qya&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7162427)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/qya&quot;  &gt;Qya&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
