strong>SCP-5127:</strong> No. I am a god. You are a fool who doesn't address me by my name. You lock me up in some prison for gods, And you think that I will answer your question! Why can't I speak with one of my worshippers that visit me every week. They know how to talk to me. And how to worship me.</p> <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> I'm sorry, SCP-5127. But being a god doesn't do anything here. If you want any chance of getting out all you can do is atleast comply.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5127:</strong> No.</p> <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> I see thats how it is, Then.</p> <p><em>Doctor ███████ leaves and activates the room freezer. After SCP-5127 is frozen, SCP-5127 is sent back into containment.</em></p> <p><strong>&lt;End Log&gt;</strong></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p><strong>Footnotes:</strong><br /> A sample of the clay SCP-5127 is composed of shows that SCP-5127 was created 22 centuries ago.</p> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/qya" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7162427&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609921887" alt="Qya" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7162427)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/qya" >Qya</a></span></p> 
